# Aqua OS Production MQTT Access Control List (ACL)
# Enforces farm-level data isolation at the broker boundary.

# Pattern rule: Authenticated client (%u = username / certificate CN)
# can only publish and subscribe to its own farm topic hierarchy:
pattern readwrite aqua/%u/#

# Central backend platform service can read all farm telemetry and publish control commands:
user aqua_central_platform
topic read aqua/+/+/telemetry
topic write aqua/+/+/control

